			"notes": "- Hide armor bars and low durability warnings while HUD is hidden (F1-mode) or when in creative/spectator mode\n- Fix compatibility with [Raised](<https://modrinth.com/mod/raised>) 1.2.0 and later\n- Add compatibility for [Double Hotbar](<https://modrinth.com/mod/double-hotbar>)\n- Add option to offset elements' y-positions by a custom amount\n- Fix low durability warning blink speed being tied to framerate\n- Support all Minecraft versions from 1.16 to 1.21"
		},
